
//make truth table for (p | !q) ->: (p & q)

//on Mac: Command-Shift-W 

---------------------------------
p q # (p v !q) ->: (p & q)
---------------------------------
T T #     T F   T      T
T F #     T T   F      F
F T #     F F   T      F
F F #     T T   F      F
---------------------------------

Contingent 
T: [T T] [F T]
F: [T F] [F F]